---
title: "get_beacon_proposer_indices (Fulu -- The Beacon Chain)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_active: indices = get_active_validator_indices(state, epoch)
    q_active --> q_seed: seed = get_seed(state, epoch, DOMAIN_BEACON_PROPOSER)
    q_seed --> q_compute: result = compute_proposer_indices(state, epoch, seed, indices)
    q_compute --> [*]: return result
    note right of q_compute
        INV-001: Only active validators for the given epoch are considered
        INV-002: Seed is domain-separated using DOMAIN_BEACON_PROPOSER
        INV-003: Delegates to compute_proposer_indices for deterministic selection
    end note
